        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS** PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST** BEAUTIFUL 1 BED / 1 BATH APARTMENT**\n*** 1 BEDROOM 1 BATHROOM TOP FLOOR APARTMENT *** SPACIOUS SUNNY BALCONY *** VERY MODERN INTERIOR *** GREAT LOCATION *** AVAILABLE NOW!!\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 1 bedroom 1 bathroom apartment to the lettings market. This apartment in turn key condition tucked away in Rathcoole a hugely sought after location. This superb property is ideally located in the heart of Rathcoole Village and every conceivable local amenity can be found within walking distance including shops, restaurants, An Poitin Still, Schools, Rathcoole Park and Avoca, the location is truly next to none. Bright and spacious living accommodation comprises of entrance hall, open plan kitchen/living area, balcony, spacious double bedroom and a main bathroom. The apartment boasts modern interior and a sunny balcony with leafy views. AVAILABLE NOW and viewing is highly advised.\nKey Features:\n-1 bedroom 1 bathroom\n-Fully furnished\n-Finished to the highest standards\n-Freshly painted throughout\n-Fully fitted kitchen\n-Integrated appliances\n-Double bedroom\n-Built in wardrobes\n-Fully tiled bathroom\n-Gas fired central heating\n-Ample parking\n-Secure and gated development\n-In the heart of Rathcoole village\n-Superb location\n-AVAILABLE NOW!!\n**RAY COOKE LETTINGS*** EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE- FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE***"
